{"results":[{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/birla-anayu-walkeshwar/31224","title":"Birla Anayu, Malabar Hill — Price, Possession & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Birla Anayu](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/31224/main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51900077140RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Birla Anayu\n\nby Birla Estates\n\n📍 Malabar Hill, Walkeshwar · 400006\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Primary inventory recorded**\n\nAsk an advisor to verify current developer inventory and price.\n\nSource stage: Under Construction · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹120,000**\n\n46% above avg\n\n₹\n\n## Walkeshwar — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹71,969/sqft\n\nmedian · 19 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹195.2/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹210,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.3%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹175,000/sqft** — **143% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nMar 2029\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price