y-road) \n\n### [Birla Estates Wellesley Road](/projects/birla-estates-wellesley-road)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nPhase 1 launched with 2 towers, ~500 units · Phase 2 (2 more towers) yet to launch\n\nSangamwadi, Central Pune, Pune\n\n₹90 Lakh - ₹4.25 Cr\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 3.5 BHK, 4.5 BHK\n\nRERA Possession September 2031\n\n[![Birla Estates Digha Gaon](/images/projects/birla-estates-digha-gaon.webp) Pre-Launch](/projects/birla-estates-digha-gaon) \n\n### [Birla Estates Digha Gaon](/projects/birla-estates-digha-gaon)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nKalwa, Thane\n\n₹1.50 Cr - ₹2.5 Cr (indicative, unconfirmed)\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\n[![Birla Thane](/images/projects/birla-thane.webp) Pre-Launch](/projects/birla-thane) \n\n### [Birla Thane](/projects/birla-thane)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nKalwa, Thane\n\nPrice on Request\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\n[![Birla Commercial Shettigere Doddajala](/images/projects/birla-commercial-shettigere-doddajala.webp) Pre-Launch](/projects/birla-commercial-shettigere-doddajala) \n\n### [Birla Commercial Shettigere Doddajala](/projects/birla-commercial-shettigere-doddajala)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nDevanahalli, Bangalore\n\nPrice on Request\n\nOffice Spaces, Retail Shops\n\n[![Birla Apple Aroma](/images/projects/birla-apple-aroma.webp) Under Construction](/projects/birla-apple-aroma) \n\n### [Birla Apple Aroma](/projects/birla-apple-aroma)\n\nby Birla Estates Private Limited\n\nJP Nagar, Bangalore\n\n₹0.66 Cr - ₹0.83 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 2.5 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nRERA Possession March 2026\n\n## In the News\n\n[![Hyderabad Metro Phase 2 Dpr Submitted To Centre: 122.9 Km, ₹38,595 Crore Expansion Targets Kokapet, Financial District And Airport Corridor Reshaping West Hyderabad Real Estate](/images/news/hyderabad-metro-phase-2-dpr-submitted-to-centre-122-9-km-38-595-crore-expansion--1.webp) News](/news/hyderabad-metro-phase-2-dpr-submitted-to-centre-1229-km-38595-crore-expansion-targets-kokapet-financial-district-and-airport-corridor-reshaping-west-hyderabad-real-estate) \n\n### [Hyderabad Metro Phase 2 Dpr Submitted To Centre: 122.9 Km, ₹38,595 Crore Expansion Targets Kokapet, Financial District And Airport Corridor Reshaping West Hyderabad Real Estate](/news/hyderabad-metro-phase-2-dpr-submitted-to-centre-1229-km-38595-crore-expansion-targets-kokapet-financial-district-and-airport-corridor-reshaping-west-hyderabad-real-estate)\n\nHyderabad Metro Phase 2 DPR approved in May 2026: 122.9 km, 7 corridors, ₹38,595 crore. Kokapet, airport link, Old City expansion. Buyer impact explained.\n\n[![Blackstone Acquires 40 Percent Stake In Kolte-Patil Developers For ₹1,166 Crore Marking First Major Private Equity Entry Into India's Residential Real Estate Sector](/images/news/blackstone-acquires-40-percent-stake-in-kolte-patil-developers-for-1-166-crore-m-1.webp) News](/news/blackstone-acquires-40-percent-stake-in-kolte-patil-developers-for-1166-crore-marking-first-major-private-equity-entry-into-indias-residential-real-estate-sector) \n\n### [Blackstone Acquires 40 Percent Stake In Kolte-Patil Developers For ₹1,166 Crore Marking First Major Private Equity Entry Into India's Residential Real Estate Sector](/news/blackstone-acquires-40-percent-stake-in-kolte-patil-developers-for-1166-crore-marking-first-major-private-equity-entry-into-indias-residential-real-estate-sector)\n\nBlackstone's ₹1,166 crore stake in Kolte-Patil Developers marks PE's first major residential entry in India. What this means for homebuyers in Pune, Mumbai...\n\n[![Birla Estates Launches Birla 71 Ultra-Luxury Residential Project In Sector 71 SPR Road Gurugram With RERA Registration And ₹2,500 Crore Revenue Potential](/images/news/birla-estates-launches-birla-71-ultra-luxury-residential-project-in-sector-71-sp-1.webp) News](/news/birla-estates-launches-birla-71-ultra-luxury-residential-project-in-sector-71-spr-road-gurugram-with-rera-registration-and-2500-crore-revenue-potential) \n\n### [Birla Estates Launc